  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>></mo><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi><mtext>   </mtext><mi>r</mi><mo>></mo><mi>R</mi></math> <br > <img src=\"assets\\st0020_e803361a72c7.png\"/> <br > <math><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math> <br >Clearly from Gauss' Law  <math><mo>⇒</mo></math>  Option  <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>  is correct.<br > <math><mo>⇒</mo></math>  for  <math><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mtext>   </mtext><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> <br > <img src=\"assets\\st0020_3202e6ae0eb2.png\"/> <br > <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mtext> charge</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><msup><mrow><mn>53</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> <br >Where,  <math><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>53</mn><mo>°</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></math> <br > <math><mo>∴</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mtext> </mtext><mfrac><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> <br > <math><mo>∴</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><msub><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math> <br > <math><mo>∴</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>h</mi><mo>></mo><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> <br > <math><mo>∴</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><msub><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo></math>  Option  <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>  is incorrect.<br > <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>⇒</mo></math>  suppose  <math><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mtext>   </mtext><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> <br > <img src=\"assets\\st0020_de3ba6fe1acb.png\"/> <br > <math><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>  (as no charge is enclosed inside the cylinder, as shown in diagram)<br >So for  <math><mi>h</mi><mo><</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo></math>  Option  <math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>)</mo></math>  is correct.<br > <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>⇒</mo></math>  like option  <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>  for  <math><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> <br > <math><msub><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><msup><mrow><mn>37</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> <br > <math><mo>∴</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><msub><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo></math>  Option  <math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>)</mo></math>  is correct."
  }
}